"shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"CTAQDdtQbVpGw5FysZ6cEA","review_id":"wiw_n0_QDfFs41mvof550g","date":"2015-07-23T18:14:49","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.922815203666687,"text_excerpt":"Self proclaimed Manhattanite sushi snob here. Never thought I could stomach food court sushi until I found Jazz. Consistently fresh, tasty, and customizable rolls. Excellent place to go if you are just passing through or work in the area. Very reasonable prices for the quality of food that you get.The only reason for the missing star is the lack of ambiance in the food court and during busy hours counter service can be quite slow. Highly recommend. Give it a chance."},{"business_id":"CTAQDdtQbVpGw5FysZ6cEA","review_id":"3AzhjMi2wjyW7kEYITBVjg","date":"2020-12-13T20:33:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9218921065330505,"text_excerpt":"I haven't been here in quite some time. I'm glad I decided to come back. The sushi is delicious! You'd never think it'd come from the food court of the Jax Brewery building. This is the only reason I come here. My soul is very pleased with my decision to come back here to get sushi"},{"business_id":"CTAQDdtQbVpGw5FysZ6cEA","review_id":"0WBZrcvMgyv9gd7oIjtE8w","date":"2017-08-13T02:58:59","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9175032377243042,"text_excerpt":"I love the decatur rolls i add cream cheese and brown rice instead of white and omg the fried ice cream is to die for very tasty. I just wish they would update the restaurant a little better. One of the guys is a sweetheart as well I forgot his name but he make sure I'm taken care of to the max. Overall the service has always been superior and sushi is better than most restaurants I've eaten at. Don't sleep on jazz sushi."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"CTAQDdtQbVpGw5FysZ6cEA","photo_id":"mN1OV208Du8k7zmzPjhK5Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/mN1OV208Du8k7zmzPjhK5Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8891072273254395},{"business_id":"CTAQDdtQbVpGw5FysZ6cEA","photo_id":"zRmZYdBcpxu1tKL8iQG7mw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/zRmZYdBcpxu1tKL8iQG7mw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8851842880249023},{"business_id":"CTAQDdtQbVpGw5FysZ6cEA","photo_id":"V-5uFQD_bhA3tt1Dcio8Qw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/V-5uFQD_bhA3tt1Dcio8Qw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8606749773025513},{"business_id":"CTAQDdtQbVpGw5FysZ6cEA","photo_id":"NyOBRZ9ygPnfWhSwxbK1cA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/NyOBRZ9ygPnfWhSwxbK1cA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7163995504379272}]},"notebook_case":null}
